Penthes is a city on [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]], ruled by a duke and once worked by slaves. Beneath it lies the undercity of Old Penthes.

When [[People/Rotok|Rotok]] was called there by an old friend, a freedom fighter, the party took up the fight against the duke and for the freedom of the city's slaves. They found that the duke was the puppet of a noble, [[People/Dahl|Dahl]], and a failed attempt on Dahl's life showed him to be a powerful necromancer. Fleeing, they went down into Old Penthes and found it filled with an army of the dead of Dahl's making, and with a [[Bestiary/False Hydra|False Hydra]], which they slew before they escaped.
